1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,392
When does a module deserve its own service?

2
00:00:02,392 --> 00:00:07,880
The card vault holds card numbers, so it needs stricter security, and its own audit scope.

3
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:12,333
Because it only ever talked through its interface, we can move it out cleanly.

4
00:00:12,333 --> 00:00:16,369
The in-process call becomes a REST call, behind the very same port.

5
00:00:16,369 --> 00:00:19,095
It gets its own database, and its own deploy.

6
00:00:19,095 --> 00:00:24,178
The payment flow works exactly as before, now across two services.

7
00:00:24,178 --> 00:00:27,535
That is the whole system, built part by part, from one map.

